WEBVTT

00:00:07.350 --> 00:00:08.990
Okay, what abstract concept

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.310
are we trying to comprehend today?

00:00:10.430 --> 00:00:12.070
Um... Loneliness.

00:00:12.390 --> 00:00:14.350
Hmm. Looks like
there's something in there.

00:00:14.430 --> 00:00:15.590
I'm going to turn it on for a minute

00:00:15.710 --> 00:00:16.790
and burn out the gunk.

00:00:17.030 --> 00:00:19.630
BING BONG: What did I tell you?
You'll be at Headquarters in no time.

00:00:19.710 --> 00:00:20.870
SADNESS: Whoa!

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:22.070
BING BONG: Say,
would you look at that?

00:00:22.550 --> 00:00:24.390
Whoa! What's happening?

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:25.830
Oh, no, they turned it on.

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:27.950
Huh. Never seen this before.

00:00:28.150 --> 00:00:30.710
(BOTH SCREAMING)

00:00:30.910 --> 00:00:34.070
My face! My beautiful face! Oh!

00:00:34.350 --> 00:00:35.870
-What is going on?
-We're abstracting!

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:38.070
There are four stages. This is the first:

00:00:38.190 --> 00:00:39.910
Non-objective Fragmentation!

00:00:39.990 --> 00:00:41.070
All right. Do not panic.

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:44.270
What is important is that
we all stay together. Oh!

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:45.950
(JOY EXCLAIMS)

00:00:46.110 --> 00:00:47.550
We're in the second stage.
We're deconstructing!

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.910
Run! Ah!

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.150
I can't feel my legs!

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:53.910
Oh, there they are.

00:00:54.070 --> 00:00:55.190
Come here, me!

00:00:55.870 --> 00:00:56.870
(SADNESS GRUNTING)

00:00:56.950 --> 00:00:58.470
We've got to get out of here
(YELLS IN PAIN)

00:00:58.590 --> 00:01:00.230
before we're nothing
but shape and color!

00:01:00.310 --> 00:01:02.470
Ow! We'll get stuck here forever!

00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:04.350
Stuck? Why did we come in here?

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:06.670
I told you, it's a shortcut!

00:01:06.790 --> 00:01:08.950
-(TRAIN HONKING HORN)
-(GASPS) The train!

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:10.950
(ALL GRUNTING)

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:15.950
SADNESS: Oh, no. We're
two-dimensional! That's stage three!

00:01:16.030 --> 00:01:17.070
We're getting nowhere!

00:01:17.430 --> 00:01:19.750
-Depth! I'm lacking depth!
-Come on.

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:21.110
(JOY GRUNTING)

00:01:23.310 --> 00:01:24.630
We can't fit.

00:01:25.110 --> 00:01:26.950
SADNESS: Oh, no, we're Nonfigurative.

00:01:27.070 --> 00:01:28.630
This is the last stage!

00:01:28.710 --> 00:01:29.950
BING BONG: We're not going to make it!

00:01:30.430 --> 00:01:31.670
(SADNESS GROANING)

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:35.670
SADNESS: Wait! We're
two-dimensional. Fall on your face!

00:01:39.310 --> 00:01:40.310
(BELL RINGING)

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:45.990
(JOY GRUNTING)

00:01:46.870 --> 00:01:48.590
JOY: Stop! Stop!

00:01:50.350 --> 00:01:53.150
Oh, no! I thought you said
that was a shortcut.

00:01:53.230 --> 00:01:56.070
I did, but wow,
we should not have gone in there.

00:01:56.230 --> 00:01:58.110
That was dangerous!
They really should put up a sign.

00:01:58.310 --> 00:01:59.350
How long until the next train?

00:01:59.710 --> 00:02:01.670
-Who knows. But don't worry.
-(GROANING)

00:02:01.750 --> 00:02:03.230
There's another station. That way.

00:02:03.390 --> 00:02:04.790
The train always stops there.

00:02:04.950 --> 00:02:06.470
Right before it goes to Headquarters.

00:02:06.550 --> 00:02:08.310
If we hurry, we can catch it.

00:02:08.630 --> 00:02:10.670
This isn't another one
of your shortcuts, is it?

00:02:10.790 --> 00:02:12.550
(LAUGHING) Yeah!

00:02:13.510 --> 00:02:14.830
(WHISPERING) Is there
really another station?

00:02:14.910 --> 00:02:16.230
Uh-huh. Through there.

00:02:18.790 --> 00:02:21.030
BING BONG: Welcome to
Imagination Land!

00:02:21.350 --> 00:02:22.270
(GASPS) Imagination Land?

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:23.510
BING BONG: Sure!

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:25.910
I come here all the time.
I'm practically the mayor.

00:02:26.030 --> 00:02:28.710
Hey, you guys hungry?
There's French Fry Forest!

00:02:28.870 --> 00:02:30.710
-Mmm! Delicious.
-No way!

00:02:30.790 --> 00:02:31.830
-(LAUGHING)
-(BING BONG EXCLAIMING)

00:02:31.910 --> 00:02:33.910
BING BONG: Check it out!
Trophy Town!

00:02:33.990 --> 00:02:36.910
Medals! Ribbons! Everyone's a winner!

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:39.070
I won first place!

00:02:39.190 --> 00:02:42.310
-Me too!
-Oh, participation award.

00:02:42.630 --> 00:02:45.350
Wait, is that... Sadness,
look, it's Cloud Town!

00:02:45.430 --> 00:02:47.110
(GASPS) That is my favorite!

00:02:47.230 --> 00:02:49.430
(WHOOPING) Oh, it's so soft!

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:51.030
Oh! Let me try.

00:02:51.150 --> 00:02:53.030
Hey! What's the big idea?

00:02:53.150 --> 00:02:55.550
You better fix that wall,
or else you're in big troub...

00:02:56.630 --> 00:02:57.750
(WHISTLING)

00:02:57.950 --> 00:03:00.790
Oh, no! Lava! Whoo! Oh!

00:03:00.910 --> 00:03:02.750
Imagination Land is the best!

00:03:03.390 --> 00:03:06.750
Oh, is it all going to be so interactive?

00:03:06.950 --> 00:03:09.110
Hey, look! The House of Cards!

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:10.870
Oh, wait. Hang on just a minute.

00:03:11.270 --> 00:03:13.110
-JOY: (GASPS) Your rocket!
-Yeah.

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:14.950
I stashed it in there for safekeeping,

00:03:15.030 --> 00:03:17.430
and now I'm all set to
take Riley to the moon!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.070
-Oh, I'm sorry.
-Great.

00:03:20.550 --> 00:03:22.550
Oh, I love Imagination Land.

00:03:22.750 --> 00:03:24.990
Isn't it great? And there's
always something new, like...

00:03:28.070 --> 00:03:29.230
BING BONG: Who the heck is that?

00:03:29.470 --> 00:03:30.590
Imaginary boyfriend.

00:03:30.910 --> 00:03:32.430
I would die for Riley.

00:03:32.590 --> 00:03:34.590
-(EXCLAIMS IN DISGUST)
-Oh, I've never seen him before.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:35.990
I live in Canada.

00:03:36.470 --> 00:03:38.830
Anyway, this way.
Through Preschool World!

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:40.150
We're nearly to the train!

00:03:40.310 --> 00:03:40.990
Riley, here we come! Whoo-hoo!

00:03:42.230 --> 00:03:43.230
(BING BONG LAUGHS)

00:03:44.310 --> 00:03:47.590
This should be fun!
New team, new friends.

00:03:47.990 --> 00:03:49.270
These kids look pretty good,

00:03:49.470 --> 00:03:50.990
considering they're from San Francisco.

00:03:51.110 --> 00:03:52.270
COACH: Okay, Andersen, you're up!

00:03:52.470 --> 00:03:53.990
-Got to go.
-Okay.

00:03:54.110 --> 00:03:55.310
Good luck, sweetie!

00:03:55.470 --> 00:03:56.590
Luck isn't going to help us now.

00:03:56.670 --> 00:03:58.470
If she tries to use Hockey Island,
it's going down.

00:03:58.590 --> 00:04:00.230
Which is why I've recalled

00:04:00.310 --> 00:04:01.950
every hockey memory I can think of.

00:04:02.190 --> 00:04:03.350
One of these has got to work

00:04:03.470 --> 00:04:04.870
-in place of the Core Memory.
-(WHISTLE BLOWING)

00:04:04.990 --> 00:04:06.310
-She's about to play!
-Hurry!

00:04:12.230 --> 00:04:13.270
(POWERING UP)

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:16.350
Ha-ha! We did it, gang! It's working!

00:04:16.670 --> 00:04:17.670
Oh!

00:04:17.830 --> 00:04:19.350
-(POWERING DOWN)
-(YELPS)

00:04:19.790 --> 00:04:21.350
COACH: Line change! Line change!

00:04:21.510 --> 00:04:23.310
-(GRUNTING)
-COACH: Change it up!

00:04:23.910 --> 00:04:25.150
(EXCLAIMING)

00:04:28.230 --> 00:04:30.150
(LAUGHS) No! No! Aah!

00:04:31.510 --> 00:04:32.510
(GRUNTS)

00:04:35.630 --> 00:04:37.030
DISGUST: It's like
we don't learn anything.

00:04:37.270 --> 00:04:39.190
RILEY: Come on!
COACH: Let's pick it up out there!

00:04:39.310 --> 00:04:40.910
GIRL: Pass! Shoot it! Shoot it!

00:04:41.030 --> 00:04:42.070
Oh!

00:04:42.150 --> 00:04:43.790
(PANTING)

00:04:44.350 --> 00:04:45.790
-That's it!
-No, no, no! Breathe.

00:04:45.870 --> 00:04:47.390
Find your happy place. (CHOKES)

00:04:48.150 --> 00:04:49.150
(YELLING)

00:04:50.670 --> 00:04:52.790
-(RILEY GRUNTS)
-GIRL: What's her problem?

00:04:55.830 --> 00:04:57.350
(RILEY GRUNTING)

00:04:59.430 --> 00:05:01.310
-Riley. What's wrong?
-Let's go.

00:05:01.430 --> 00:05:02.790
MOM: You're not going to finish tryouts?

00:05:02.870 --> 00:05:04.150
-What's the point?
-Hey.

00:05:04.310 --> 00:05:06.390
It'll be all right. Let's just go back...

00:05:06.470 --> 00:05:08.350
Stop saying everything will be all right!

00:05:08.550 --> 00:05:09.550
(GIRLS CHEERING)

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:12.190
COACH: Nice hustle, ladies!

00:05:12.470 --> 00:05:13.910
(GIRLS LAUGHING)

00:05:16.070 --> 00:05:17.230
(RUMBLING)

00:05:20.110 --> 00:05:21.190
Hockey?

00:05:24.350 --> 00:05:28.550
Oh, no, no, she loves hockey.
She can't give up hockey.

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:29.910
DAD: Hey! Look at that!

00:05:30.030 --> 00:05:31.190
-Very nice shot!
-MOM: Hey!

00:05:31.310 --> 00:05:32.950
Bing Bong, we have to
get to that station.

00:05:33.070 --> 00:05:34.070
Sure thing. This way,

00:05:34.190 --> 00:05:35.830
just past Graham Cracker Castle. Hey.

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.190
That's weird.

00:05:37.270 --> 00:05:38.710
Graham Cracker Castle
used to be right here.

00:05:38.790 --> 00:05:41.070
BING BONG: I wonder why
they moved it? Wow, that's not...

00:05:41.270 --> 00:05:43.630
I would have sworn
Sparkle Pony Mountain was right here.

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:45.390
-Hey, what's going on?
-Yeah, yeah... I don't know...

00:05:45.470 --> 00:05:47.110
-We'll have to come back.
-(GASPS) Princess Dream World!

00:05:49.950 --> 00:05:52.590
Oh, no! The stuffed
Animal Hall of Fame!

00:05:54.430 --> 00:05:55.630
(GASPS) My rocket!

00:05:56.430 --> 00:05:58.510
BING BONG: Wait! Riley and I,
we're still using that rocket!

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:01.110
It still has some song power left!

00:06:01.230 --> 00:06:02.790
♪ Who's your friend who likes to play? ♪

00:06:02.950 --> 00:06:04.510
(DISTORTED TUNE PLAYING)

00:06:09.190 --> 00:06:12.830
No! No, no, no. No, you can't
take my rocket to the dump!

00:06:12.950 --> 00:06:14.470
Riley and I are going to the moon!

00:06:16.030 --> 00:06:17.030
Oh!

00:06:17.110 --> 00:06:18.630
(BING BONG WHIMPERING)

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.310
Riley can't be done with me.

